   "description": "Spaceman was the first colorway imagined for the SW0284 collection. Inspired by Saturn, astronomy, and humanity's fascination with exploration, it represents the idea that time is measured not only on the wrist, but also in the movement of the heavens. The textured black dial reflects the depth of space itself. Tiny variations across the surface evoke distant stars, meteorites, and the endless darkness beyond our atmosphere. The blue and orange 24-hour register draws inspiration from spaceflight equipment while naturally representing the transition between day and night.",
